---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Facilities"
  description="Experimental facilities used by the CAL-Pathfinder collaboration at UC Berkeley."
>

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <!--<span class="eyebrow">Infrastructure</span>-->
      <h1>Facilities</h1>
      <p class="desc">
        We operate three cryogenic systems in our lab spaces in Birge Hall and in a shared space in Etcheverry Hall.<br><br>
        We also work at LBNL facilities including the Molecular Foundry and within the Superconducting Magnet Program.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

 


 
  <hr class="divider">

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label"></span>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;">





        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 300px;">
              <img src="../public/images/rita_gradstudents.png" alt="Rita Cryostat with Grad Students" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:18px">Rita: Bluefors LD400 Dilution Refrigerator</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                Rita is the principal fridge for the CAL-Pathfinder axion experiment and is equipped with a 9 T superconducting solenoid magnet.
                In addition, it is instrumented with RF cabling for qubit sensor development.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>



        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 300px;">
              <img src="../public/images/rufus.jpg" alt="Rufus Cryostat" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:18px">Rufus: Bluefors LD250 Dilution Refrigerator</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                Rufus is the main qubit sensor fridge. 
                The fridge is equipped with RF cabling and photon calibration systems for optical and THz photons.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>







        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 300px;">
              <img src="../public/images/remy.jpg" alt="Remy Cryostat" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:18px">Remy: 4 K Dry Cryostat</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                Remy is a custom 4 K cryostat used for auxillary cryogenic testing. 
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>



      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


</Layout>
